  m_text: 'In Mines, a grid hides stars and landmines. Your goal is to uncover stars
    and avoid hitting a mine.

    Each safe pick increases your multiplier and potential
    payout.

    You can cash out anytime to secure your winnings or keep playing
    for bigger rewards.

    The more mines you set, the higher the risk and payout.

    An
    Auto Play option lets you customize and automate your strategy.'
